# 02_power_nap.ledc — Power Nap (~22:30) — descend to delta ~3.4 Hz, brief floor, re-ascend to wake
# Goal: NASA-style restorative nap. Drop-in 10 Hz -> delta ~3.4 Hz over ~16 min, brief
#       floor/hold, then a deliberate re-ascent 3.4 -> 7 -> 12 Hz to wake before sleep
#       inertia sets in. Ends bright and awake — NO fade-out (this is the sanctioned
#       power-nap wake exception, see guidelines §4).
# Bands: alpha 10 -> delta 3.4 (rest) -> theta 7 -> SMR/low-beta 12; audio beat finishes 14 Hz.
# Safety (§4): LED flicker CAPPED at 12 Hz — the final 12->14 Hz wake is AUDIO-ONLY (LED held
#       at 12 Hz). Never enters the 15–25 Hz danger band. Brightness capped 50%; LED ramps in
#       over 10 s (0->25%) and fades off over 2 min (4:00->6:00), no abrupt edges. Warm amber
#       (255,100,0) descending -> off during rest -> amber->warm white (255,200,120) on wake.
#       No saturated-red strobe, no red/blue alternation. Audio peaks 65/100.
#
# Encoding (§5a): freq_R is NOT interpolatable, so the binaural beat is slid by ramping the
#       LEFT carrier `frequency` with freq_R held FIXED at 255 Hz. Perceived beat = 255 − carrier.
#       Nap goes down then up, so the carrier rises (descent) then falls (re-ascent):
#         beat 10=245, 9.5=245.5, 4=251, 3.9=251.1, 3.4=251.6, 7=248, 12=243, 14=241.
#       Carrier stays 241–255 Hz (<1000), offset ≤14 Hz (<35) — satisfies §3 binaural rules.
# Audio: ch1, sine (wave 0), pan 0 (centered; freq_R provides the L/R split), mod 0, freq_R=255.
# LED:   mask 255 (all 8 channels), duty 50% throughout, flicker tracks the beat 1:1 up to 12 Hz.
# Ramp convention: animate-on-start — `>` prefix on the EARLIER entry; target = next same-channel entry.

# ── Drop-in (00:00–00:30): 10 Hz warm amber, brightness ramp-in; binaural beat 10 Hz ──────────
0      >10 50 >0   255 100 0 255             # LED all-ch: 10 Hz, brightness 0->25 over 10 s ramp-in, amber
10000  >10 50 >25  255 100 0 255             # brightness reaches 25% (held); LED freq begins glide 10->4
A 0     >245   0 >0  0 1 255 0               # ch1 binaural: carrier 245 / freq_R 255 = 10 Hz beat; vol fade-in 0->50
A 30000 >245.5 0 50  0 1 255 0               # 00:30 vol fade-in complete (50); carrier glides on toward 251 (beat 4)

# ── Delta glide (04:00–06:00): beat 10->4 reached at 04:00; ease volume + fade light off ──────
240000 >4   50 >25 255 >100 0 255            # 04:00 LED freq 4->3.9; brightness 25->0 (2-min fade); amber 100->80
A 240000 >251 0 >50 0 1 255 0                # 04:00 beat=4; carrier 251->251.1; vol eases 50->30

# ── Delta rest (06:00): quiet anchor, light essentially OFF, beat glides on toward 3.4 ─────────
360000 >3.9 50 0  255 80 0 255               # 06:00 LED freq 3.9->3.4; light OFF (held); dim warm amber
A 360000 >251.1 0 30 0 1 255 0               # 06:00 beat~3.9; carrier 251.1->251.6; vol holds 30 (restful core)

# ── Delta floor (16:00): deepest point, dark, brief floor/hold ─────────────────────────────────
960000 3.4 50 0  255 80 0 255                # 16:00 LED freq 3.4 (held, floor); dark
A 960000 251.6 0 30 0 1 255 0                # 16:00 beat=3.4 (carrier 251.6 held = floor/hold); vol 30

# ── Re-ascent (17:00–22:30): WAKE — freq, brightness, volume all rise together; amber->white ──
1020000 >3.4 50 >0  255 100 0 255            # 17:00 wake begins: LED 3.4->7; brightness 0->25; amber returns
A 1020000 >251.6 0 >30 0 1 255 0             # 17:00 beat 3.4->7 (carrier 251.6->248); vol 30->45
1140000 >7 50 >25 255 >100 >0 255            # 19:00 theta pass: LED 7->12; brightness 25->50; color begins warming
A 1140000 >248 0 >45 0 1 255 0               # 19:00 beat 7->12 (carrier 248->243); vol 45->60
1260000 12 50 50 255 >150 >60 255            # 21:00 LED flicker reaches 12 Hz CAP (held); bright 50%; warming toward white
A 1260000 >243 0 >60 0 1 255 0               # 21:00 beat=12 (carrier 243); audio beat now ramps 12->14 (audio-only above cap); vol 60->65
1350000 12 50 50 255 200 120 255             # 22:30 LED held at 12 Hz (audio carries 14); bright warm-white; AWAKE — no fade-out
A 1350000 241 0 65 0 1 255 0                 # 22:30 audio beat 14 Hz (carrier 241); vol 65; session ends bright/awake
